# Roblox place and model files are byte-exact artifacts: their sha256 is cited
# in receipts and manifests, so git must never line-ending convert them.
# B2-109 2026-09-26: core.autocrlf=true expanded the 383,204-byte LF blob of
# roblox/the_mountain.rbxlx to a 391,573-byte CRLF working copy on checkout,
# which would shift its sha on any renormalization pass.
*.rbxlx binary
*.rbxm binary
